  "project_description": "Provides a form to debug tokens:\n\n \n Fill in some entity types/IDs like node:17 \n Browse tokens (needs token module) \n Fill in some text with tokens, like This is node \"[node:title]\" by \"[node:author:name]\". \n Click Submit \n => See the text with tokens replaced, like This is node \"Test page\" by \"admin\". \n Optionally, get a dump of token cacheability (cache tags, contexts, and max-age)",
